'''Li'l King Dragon Cat''' (ちびネコキングドラゴン ''Chibi Neko Kingu Doragon'', '''Chibi Dragon King Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Tail (Deadly)|Li'l Lizard Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
