|appearance = [[Tiny Tail (Deadly)|Li'l Lizard Awakens!]]
[[Path to +45|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 1,350¢ - 5,332¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has very long range, quick attacks, and decent damage. They're not too bad alone, but the stage spawns multiple of them.

